+**Audit boundary**: An initial freeze was rejected because its status/source
+closure/tests were incomplete.  A second attempted refit was interrupted when
+the independent auditor found that the shared manifest validator materialized
+forbidden `response_scores`.  The final runner uses metadata-only manifest
+validation and a guarded seven-member NPZ loader.  Eight focused tests pass;
+the final A/B trees are byte-identical at manifest SHA-256
+`8402c816fb6c1b7fe0146fa0db7ddf970b0347419ed78dd51ccfdaf150583a30`.
+The independent auditor and the bound verifier both reconstructed all 288
+method-cell step-score vectors byte-exactly with maximum error `0.0`, then the
+auditor issued PASS before any target table was opened.
+
+**Result**: The correlation premise passes in 12/12 cells: same-transform mean
+absolute Spearman `0.901102`, same-source `0.565975`, neither `0.524352`.
